            "block_content": "12. In the event the services of an eligible employee are terminated, voluntarily or involuntarily for any reason whatsoever, except a discharge due to dishonesty, before the vacation earned has been taken, there shall be paid to such employee one-twelfth (1/12th) of the annual vacation grant for each full month worked during the vacation year.",
